hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1123","(149) Ghudsawar aur pyada ke hisse ka bab: al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Mu'awiyah al-Darir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubayd Allah ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne (ghudsawar) shakhs aur us ke ghore ke liye teen hisse muqarrar farmaye: ek hissa us ke liye, aur do hisse us ke ghore ke liye."
